# fleet-dao 本机档（fleet-local，#731）：每分钟拉起一次 fleet-wsl-loopback.service——WSL 网络变动时要是把回环规则冲掉了，
# 最多一分钟补回来（补的那一次在 journalctl -u fleet-wsl-loopback 里有一行）。deploy/local/install.sh 装，别手改。
[Unit]
Description=fleet-dao: re-apply WSL loopback rules every minute

[Timer]
OnActiveSec=1min
OnUnitActiveSec=1min
AccuracySec=10s

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
